{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151380/extras/trailer3.gif?t=1749197265\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Small Spaces is a relaxing game about designing beautiful, small apartments you'd want to live in. Let your creativity flow from a simplistic flat in Tokyo to an industrial loft in New York. Your only limit is the space itself.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Full creativity</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151380/extras/Berlin_stairs.gif?t=1749197265\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Full creativity with limited space. Modular kitchens? Loft apartments? Find smart solutions and design unique spaces that are functional <i>and</i> beautiful with hundreds of realistic furniture pieces and materials.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Create beautiful apartments</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151380/extras/NYC2.gif?t=1749197265\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each space is inspired by architectural styles from places around the world. Each level comes with its own challenges and opportunities sparking curiosity and ideas in a way it makes you look forward to the next one.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Don\u2019t think, just do!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151380/extras/tokyo_green.gif?t=1749197265\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sit back and relax. Add indirect lighting, plants and more to decorate and personalize your space down to the smallest detail. Let your ideas flow and create your own cozy world. Small Spaces makes designing fun and easy.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3151380?t=1749197265","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151380/c6b2fc79d10d51e2260ce0a9aff7e41c3684450e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749197265","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151380/fe9591a6a65dabc2c844a081764aa130f987f4c3/capsule_231x87_alt_assets_0.jpg?t=1749197265","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151380/fe9591a6a65dabc2c844a081764aa130f987f4c3/capsule_184x69_alt_assets_0.jpg?t=1749197265","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>ROADMAP</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151380/extras/Small_Spaces_Roadmap2.png?t=1749197265\" /></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151380/extras/trailer3.gif?t=1749197265\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Small Spaces is a relaxing game about designing beautiful, small apartments you'd want to live in. Let your creativity flow from a simplistic flat in Tokyo to an industrial loft in New York. Your only limit is the space itself.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Full creativity</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151380/extras/Berlin_stairs.gif?t=1749197265\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Full creativity with limited space. Modular kitchens? Loft apartments? Find smart solutions and design unique spaces that are functional <i>and</i> beautiful with hundreds of realistic furniture pieces and materials.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Create beautiful apartments</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151380/extras/NYC2.gif?t=1749197265\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each space is inspired by architectural styles from places around the world. Each level comes with its own challenges and opportunities sparking curiosity and ideas in a way it makes you look forward to the next one.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Don\u2019t think, just do!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151380/extras/tokyo_green.gif?t=1749197265\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sit back and relax. Add indirect lighting, plants and more to decorate and personalize your space down to the smallest detail. Let your ideas flow and create your own cozy world. Small Spaces makes designing fun and easy.</p>","developers":["Niklas Tomkowitz"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151380/fd5efe998b6b5a41fc482d3c456193c7787314c4/header_alt_assets_0.jpg?t=1749197265","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Copyright \u00a9 2025 Niklas Tomkowitz. Published by Pretty Soon. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257146372,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257146372/movie480.mp4?t=1748350810","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257146372/movie_max.mp4?t=1748350810"},"name":"Small Spaces - Early Access Release Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257146372/8c1d8fd3679eb30cea288e774d49f41ccbf2e046/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1748350810","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257146372/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1748350810","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257146372/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1748350810"}}],"name":"Small Spaces","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_sub